how_its_made:
- Powered by the Polygon blockchain, BubbleSwitch introduces an exceptional level of transparency and security, prioritizing user data privacy and offering a clear economic model for content creators. Now unique features are possible:
    - web2-like experience for onboarding people who are unfamiliar with cryptocurrency, using Safe account abstraction;
    - zero-knowledge KYC and age restrictions through Polygon ID, enhancing user security and privacy;
    - NFT or custom list gated communities with the assistance of Sismo Connect, fostering engagement and community building. ApeCoin holders included!
